Notebook[{
Cell["Han Kitab \:00b7 Project Context v001 (21 November 2026)", "Title"],
Cell["\:00a9 Computational Classnotes \:00b7 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0", "Text"],
Cell["State\n- Repo: https://github.com/lossofgenerality/han-kitab (main, release v001). Live page (after GitHub Pages is switched on): https://lossofgenerality.github.io/han-kitab/\n- App: `HanKitab_v001.html` \:2014 Library, Read (English / English + \:4e2d\:6587 / \:4e2d\:6587), Search, Ask, Downloads, About; installable, offline.\n- Texts: Mason, *The Arabian Prophet* (1921) clear-text edition v001; \:5929\:65b9\:81f3\:8056\:5be6\:9304 (1924) facsimile v001 (prefaces + juan 1\:201310); research report v001; both original scans unchanged in `originals/`.\n- Kernel: HanKitabKernel deployed at https://www.wolframcloud.com/obj/ccn2/HanKitabKernel; app key in Desktop/Research/HanKitab/HanKitabKernel_SECRET_private.txt and cloud object HanKitab/secret (private).\n- Notebooks: wolfram/ and Desktop/Research/HanKitab (Kernel, OperationsLog T001\:2013T032 / DO001\:2013DO008, DevelopmentLog, Scripts).", "Section"],
Cell["Open tasks\n1. Switch on GitHub Pages (Settings \:2192 Pages \:2192 Deploy from branch, main, / root), then check the live page.\n2. \:5929\:65b9\:81f3\:8056\:5be6\:9304 juan 11\:201320: find a scan of the second half (NLC, CTEXT library or NDL) and add it the same way.\n3. Proofread the Mason clear text; type in the Chinese characters marked [Chinese] from the scan.\n4. A faithful typed Chinese text of \:5929\:65b9\:81f3\:8056\:5be6\:9304 (only by reading every page; machine reading was ~80 %).\n5. More Han Kitab texts: \:5929\:65b9\:6027\:7406 (Commons NLC scans, ANU manuscript), \:5929\:65b9\:5178\:79ae (ANU), \:5929\:65b9\:6b63\:5b78 (Commons).\n6. Conventions files not yet made: Tutorial, Manual, Flowchart, Acronyms notebooks.", "Section"],
Cell["How to resume\nClone the repo, run `python3 tools/make_app_v001.py` after any text change, bump to v002 (never overwrite), log new (T)/(DO) entries in `tools/make_notebooks_v002.py`, commit as Noor Hoshino, push, verify with `git ls-remote` and the live page, copy notebooks to Desktop/Research/HanKitab.", "Section"],
Cell["\:00a9 Computational Classnotes \:00b7 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0", "Text"]
}, WindowTitle -> "HanKitabProjectContext_v001.nb"]
